    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Failed to use Wasteland to destroy opponent's Ancient Tomb, which is critical for denying the 3 mana needed to activate the lethal Painter's Servant + Grindstone combo. With Ancient Tomb destroyed, opponent would only have Mountain + Arid Mesa fetch = 2 mana on untap, insufficient to activate Grindstone (costs 3). Leaving Ancient Tomb in play gives opponent easy access to the combo kill next turn.",
